sequenceDiagram
    participant View as AgenticAiView
    participant CM as ContextManager
    participant Store as VectorStore
    participant FS as FileSystem
    participant Client as ChromaClient
    participant Coll as Collection

    Note over View,Coll: CONNECT TO STORE
    View->>CM: handleUpdateDatabase()
    CM->>CM: ensureStore({ dimensions })
    Note over CM: Dimensions resolved via:<br/>1. lastIndexResult<br/>2. Cached embeddings JSON<br/>3. Explicit parameter

    CM->>Store: VectorStore.connect({ url, collection, batchSize, dimensions })
    Store->>Client: getCollection({ name })
    alt Collection exists
        Client-->>Store: Existing collection
    else Collection not found (ChromaNotFoundError)
        Store->>Client: createCollection({ name, dimensions })
        Client-->>Store: New collection
    end
    Store->>Store: loadEmbedder(embedOptions)
    Store-->>CM: VectorStore instance

    View->>Store: on('progress', handler)

    Note over View,Coll: INGEST EMBEDDINGS
    CM->>Store: ingest({ embedFile, dimensions })

    Store->>Store: Validate required fields (embedFile, dimensions)
    Store->>FS: loadEmbeddings(embedFile)
    FS-->>Store: JSON { chunks[], model, dimensions }
    Store->>Store: Filter chunks (text.length > 50)
    Store->>Store: Prepare arrays: ids, embeddings, documents, metadatas

    Store->>Store: emit('start', { phase: 'ingest', total: N })

    loop For each batch (default 200 items)
        Store->>Coll: collection.add({ ids, embeddings, documents, metadatas })
        alt Success
            Coll-->>Store: Batch confirmed
            Store->>Store: emit('progress', { phase: 'ingest', current, total, rate })
        else Batch fails
            Store->>Store: Halve batch size (200 → 100 → 50)
            Store->>Store: emit('error', { recoverable: true, message })
            Store->>Coll: Retry with smaller batch
        end
    end

    Store->>Store: emit('complete', { phase: 'ingest' })
    Store-->>CM: IngestResult { collection, inserted, rate, totalTime }
    CM-->>View: Update complete
    View->>Store: removeListener('progress')
